  "created_at": "2025-10-24T03:10:42.000Z",
  "level_num": "custom",
  "user_id": 18605,
  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
    "panels": [
      {
        "text": "#### BEHIND THE SCENES\n\nHow does AI generate code from your words?",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/8b6420bcb71cdfde2997b6575a7034c8-behind the scene.gif",
        "key": "Generate_dancer_info-e349bed8-89d6-4efc-8a0e-29b8a1e5afb1"
      },
      {
        "text": "**Learning from examples**\n\nThis AI was trained by reading lots of text like books, articles, and computer programs.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/85951b59bbc4cc06c971712bf91da1d9-llms panel 2.gif",
        "key": "Generate_dancer_more_details-0bf87b05-fdcb-4acc-b8d2-5455e69d6e87"
      },
      {
        "text": "**Finding patterns**\n\nIt learned how words and symbols usually go together to make sense.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/f07aac64ce1d0fcf2e1a3798b39a72bb-llm panel3.gif",
        "key": "Generate_dancer_more_details-48f5d03d-6aff-4230-bbc0-75fbac278d9c"
      },
      {
        "text": "**Making predictions**\n\nThe AI doesn’t think or feel. It uses math to predict what word or symbol should come next.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/2df2eadd2ab8d72a58245b7c4454645f-llm panel 4.jpg",
        "key": "Generate_dancer_more_details-f7defbff-6781-4fcd-ba98-bb4e03422fd5"
      },
      {
        "text": "**Predicting one step at a time**\n\nWhen you give it some starting words, it predicts the next part… and then the part… and the next!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/5f07dcd1ddde8a1aefe85b2dc448151d-llm panel 5b.jpg",
        "key": "Generate_dancer_more_details-1af42de1-d2bc-4653-9e86-16d56ff2ceb3"
      },
      {
        "text": "**Building something new**\n\nBy guessing one piece at a time, it can write sentences, conversations, or even Music Lab code.\n",
        "imageUrl": "",
        "key": "Generate_dancer_more_details-90264270-422b-4ad6-86cd-c9c12253b4a6"
      },
      {
        "text": "**You’re in charge**\n\nThe AI’s guesses can be wrong or weird. You decide what to keep, fix, or try again.",
        "imageUrl": "",
        "key": "HoAI_pilot_7_music_panel-d70cb1e9-cfe8-4d04-ad6d-9b060931cbe5"
      }
    ],
    "name_suffix": "_4"
  },
